      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغَدَ</span></b> , (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغَدَ</span></b> , T, L, K, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغْدٌ</span>, T, L,)
<i>He made</i> camels <i>to turn back to the right way,</i>
or <i>road:</i> (S, L, K:) or <i>he made</i> camels <i>to keep
to the road,</i> or, <i>to the right way.</i> (T, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغَدَهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغْدٌ</span>, He hit, or hurt, his <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُغْدُود</span>.
(IKtt.)

